{"unit_id":"wertyq111__dsh-paste-preview#feature-1","repo":"wertyq111/dsh-paste-preview","commit":"cd92cfc76bc9e41541c0cb67297eb7d5ab2e3cf7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-paste-preview 的功能「纯文本模型图片改道」：根据模型输入模态，将图片改成普通文件附件供文本模型接收。粘贴、拖放或添加图片时自动判断。视觉模型仍走 DSH 原生图片路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:8-40","dsh/client.js:100-115","dsh/client.js:238-266"]}
